Description:It is your first main phase. You control Goblin King (other Goblins get +1/+1 and mountainwalk), Woodland Changeling (2/2 changeling) and Grizzly Bears. The opponent is at 3 life and controls a Mountain, an untapped Wall of Stone and a tapped Silent Arbiter (no more than one creature can attack or block each combat). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-changeling-lord-landwalk | Changeling gives every creature type (CR 702.73a), so Goblin King makes Woodland Changeling a 3/3 with mountainwalk, unblockable while the opponent controls a Mountain (CR 702.14c); the King itself gets nothing from its own ability and the Bears are blocked by the Wall
